      "status": "completed",
      "finalText": "The failed-payment automation is set up and turned on.\n\n**Workflow: Failed Payment Follow-up (`wf_007`)**: published (version 1)\n1. Email the customer the **Payment Failed Notice** template (`tpl_007`)\n2. Wait 2 days\n3. Create a task: \"Call about failed payment\"\n\n**Trigger: Payment Failed (`trg_006`)**: now runs this workflow and is switched on. It has no conditions, so every failed payment will start it.\n\nNotes:\n- The call task doesn't have an owner or due date. If you want one, I can set a specific person or a due date (for example, the same day the task is created).\n- The email step won't reach customers who have unsubscribed from email.",
